# Local env files
# Ignore every .env* variant, then re-allow the committed templates.
# Previously .env.test / .env.production / .env.staging were NOT ignored, and
# Medusa's jest setup loads .env.test -- so a developer creating one would have
# committed real credentials silently. See DAY_0_AUDIT.md F-20.
**/.env*
!**/.env.template
!**/.env.example

# Turbo
.turbo

